    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e810bd801ce9645f8614187f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对了，我记得之前还看到她\n拿着温度计到处走来走去。\n她到底在做什么呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "83bedb8001fc9ed62a9ff4408d8b9af6a403c2874e0f0e2629824b2c63fbc403",
