      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗨，奇锐骏，\n我找到愿意一起照顾糠床的人了，\n能不能让我们也来帮忙呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a48b09d1bb384310226db133687f861bc22583314aafacb9f04655226802184",
