      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏！请让我也来帮忙吧！\n虽然我对糠床不太了解……\n但毕竟我也是栗东宿舍的一员啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4721f8dc01b1566bb2268a0e630e816e1c002c654ff79eef147fb797575898a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
